7.10 LIVING STATUS OF PARENTS
Figure 44 shows the living status of parents of children below five years old. The figure reveals that
1.5 percent of the children in Ghor Province had both or either of their father or mother died. The
proportion of young children whose father has died and mother is alive was 0.7 percent while 0.6
percent for those whose mother has died and father is alive. The proportion of children below five
years old whose both parents were dead was 0.2 percent.
